   "attempted": "Not a data gap - a TRUE VACANCY, fully sourced. Davina Duerr resigned effective 2022-06-01; Bothell's council failed to fill the seat within the statutory 90 days (by 2022-08-30), so under RCW 42.12.070 the King County Council made the appointment on 2022-10-04, naming Amanda Dodd over Tom Agnew and Cary Westerbeck. Seat held by nobody 2022-06-01 to 2022-10-04.",
